  "bodyHash": "0c09bc7630452435",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\">✨让你的我的世界世界变得超可爱 🐸</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em>自定义设计的青蛙纹理为你的游戏增添一点额外的小东西。<br /></em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">纹理会根据季节自动变化！（可以关闭）</span><br /><br /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><a style=\"font-size: 20px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sapling\" rel=\"nofollow\">🌱需要安装 Sapling 模组才能使此模组工作&nbsp;🌱</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">⚙️此模组需要在客户端和服务器上均安装，这样你就可以和朋友看到相同的纹理 🤗</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1a34fad2354283d5c3278799db45c54ad1550d1f.png\" /><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6657bbb986bea9b7f37135b74dbfdeaa521673cd.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">青蛙变体在世界中随机生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">重新打开世界时，青蛙会保持自己的皮肤，把所有他们都收集起来！&nbsp;🤗</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🌸☀️🍂❄️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">纹理会根据季节自动变化。还会有普通青蛙。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">季节日期：日 - 月</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🌸春天：&nbsp;01-03 / 31-5 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☀️夏天：01-06 / 31-08</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🍂秋天：&nbsp;01-09 / 30-11 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;❄️冬天：&nbsp;01-12 / 28-02 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">还有一个命令来选择你更喜欢哪个半球！北半球或南半球 😊</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">（北半球会自动选择）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">‼️🏷️如果你想让特定青蛙在整个年度内保持某种青蛙纹理，请确保在新年季开始前给他们起一个名字标签！否则他们会改变。‼️🏷️</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>命令<br /></strong><em>⚙️</em><em>自定义你的体验。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><u>管理员工具</u></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog&nbsp;</span>adminTools flipSeasonDatesToOtherHemisphere&nbsp;&nbsp; |&nbsp;<em>切换半球</em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog&nbsp;</span>adminTools resetAllLoadedEntityTextures&nbsp;&nbsp; |&nbsp;&nbsp;<em>重置游戏中已加载的青蛙</em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;adminTools reloadConfigFile&nbsp; |&nbsp;<em>重新加载配置中的更改</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><u>配置值</u></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;setConfigValues showCurrentValues</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;setConfigValues disableSeasonsDuringHoliday (false/true)&nbsp; |&nbsp;<em>禁用假期与季节纹理混合的选项</em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;setConfigValues nameTagPreventsTexture (false/true)&nbsp; |&nbsp;<em>用名称标签保存纹理的选项或禁用它</em></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;setConfigValues replaceSeasonalTextures &nbsp;|&nbsp;<em>在更改后重新加载纹理</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><u>更新类别设置</u></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;updateCategorySettings _default&nbsp;&nbsp; | 启用或禁用原始青蛙纹理</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;updateCategorySettings&nbsp;<em>&lt;category&gt;</em>&nbsp;(disable/enable/setDate)&nbsp; |&nbsp;<em>自定义季节</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><u>更新纹理设置</u></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>/maplemods</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">frog</span>&nbsp;updateTextureSettings&nbsp;<em>&lt;texture&gt;</em>&nbsp;(disable/enable) |&nbsp;<em>选择要启用或禁用的特定纹理</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">终于能设计并发布我的自定义青蛙了！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✨ 希望你能像我喜欢创作它们一样享受看到它们跳跃的景象 ✨</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">季节性纹理还与以下模组一起提供：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/maples-bee-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">蜜蜂们！🐝</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/maples-chicken-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">小鸡们！🐥</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/maples-creeper-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">苦力怕们！💚</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/maples-rabbit-collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">兔子们！🐰</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">更多怪物即将到来！</span></p>",
